2009	    /// `EventSource` delivers frames by their `event:` name, so we subscribe to
2010	    /// `permission_request` and `permission_decision` by name (the same per-name
2011	    /// pattern the agent stream uses). The control stream is NOT session-scoped
2012	    /// server-side, so we drop any frame whose envelope `session_id` isn't ours.
